  "description": "As an avid reader of romance fantasy novels, I wasn't that surprised when I transmigrated into one. But I didn't expect it to be a multiplayer VR game beta test! Luckily, the 99 other girls are super nice, and they caught me up: all we have to do is pick a male lead and reach a happy ending. Here's the catch... We're being ranked, and the more eligible our suitor is, the more money we'll get at the end. In this game that tries to pit us against each other, can female solidarity conquer all?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
